abstract: "Python spatial simulation of woodland biomass, wood harvest and potential charcoal supply under mapped community forest management rules at Ulaya Mbuyuni, Tanzania. Five analytical rasters, scenario configurations, full numerical outputs, parameter draws and figure scripts support computational reproduction."
